    "created_at": "2025-08-27T13:43:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-29T07:54:54Z",
    "body": "> This isn't viable for the same reason we don't support screenshots. That would leak information about what is displayed on the page.\n\nCould you provide some thoughts on what form of this functionality, if any, might be considered viable? Would, for example, an \"export to PDF\" functionality be possible with the following boundaries:\n- Scripts do not get access to the generated PDF, its contents or its file handle (unlike OP's proposal).\n- The UA generates the PDF and shows the save dialog.\n- Optional: user activation is required.\n\nFull counterproposal here: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7946#issuecomment-3232210031",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
