    "updated_at": "2025-09-20T01:08:04Z",
    "body": "@domenic \n\nThis proposal is more likely to enable the programmatic way to generate a pdf buffer and download it. \n\nTo replace a package like `jspdf`.\n\nThe #7946 is more about enhancing the print dialogue to pre-select the print destination.\n\n**This proposal's goal is totally different.** Although internally it will use the same functionality to generate the pdf. \n\n**Please reopen this issue.**",
