    "body": "Yes, let's get some reactions on earlier mentioned security issues and its possible solutions/mitigations first and *only then* close this issue.\n\nFor the record, #7946 is not solely about discussing extending `window.print()`, I proposed what I think is a more elegant solution in its comments.\n\nThe difference between the two proposals is whether to allow programmatically accessing the generated PDF buffer or not.",
